"This person is gonna be one

00:03:07.212 --> 00:03:09.702
of the world's greatest luminaries

00:03:09.702 --> 00:03:11.342
in terms of teaching and learning."

00:03:11.342 --> 00:03:12.515
I had you pegged,

00:03:13.512 --> 00:03:16.342
when you went off into the
financial systems and so on

00:03:16.342 --> 00:03:17.702
that was a total surprise.

00:03:17.702 --> 00:03:20.202
But what you're doing now,
I had you pegged buddy.

